Package: easyrestore
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 python3-pyside6.qtwidgets | python3-pyside6.qtcore,
 python3-dbus,
 polkitd,
 dbus,
Recommends:
 easyrestore-helper,
 libusb-1.0-0,
Description: Guided iPhone and iPad restore for Linux
 EasyRestore is a desktop wizard that restores an iPhone or iPad from an
 IPSW file without using a terminal. This package installs the GUI.
 .
 Privileged USB restore operations are provided by easyrestore-helper.

Package: easyrestore-helper
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 python3-dbus,
 polkitd,
 dbus,
 systemd,
Recommends:
 libusb-1.0-0,
Description: Privileged helper for EasyRestore
 D-Bus activated helper that runs preflight checks and idevicerestore under
 PolicyKit authorization. The GUI talks to this helper over the system bus.
